WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.859
PostgreSQL supports a security invoker option for
views With

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:11.398
security invoker permissions on underlying relations
are checked using the invoking user's rights

00:00:13.143 --> 00:00:18.714
This can matter in a real multi-role security design
Our browser

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:23.279
lab is useful for syntax and object behavior but it
does not reproduce a full

00:00:23.306 --> 00:00:25.358
production authorization environment
